+	/**
+	 * Carries files between a bundled view and the operating system, in both directions.
+	 *
+	 * A webview cannot resolve a dropped file to a path, so upstream takes these drops away from
+	 * the iframe — it sets `pointer-events: none` on it for the duration of the drag — and lets
